            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.91</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>The app calls itself by its right name.</b> The welcome screen and the menu bar now both read Promptr Studio Pro.</li>
<li><b>A welcome screen that says what the app does.</b> The line under the logo mentioned video only. It now covers image, video and sound, and still tells you the one thing worth knowing at the start: every project is a folder on your disk, and results land there by themselves.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
